        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">
          Two warm lights from a cozy workshop: the lamp is on, the notebook is
          open, and there's room at the bench for one more idea.
        </p>
      </article>

      <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
        <article class="synth-card p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-neon-violet dark:text-neon-violet">
            Currently nearby
          </p>
